      "arguments": {
        "content": "# Product comparison\n\nCompared products: Atlas, Birch, Cedar.\n\n| Product | Price | Project limit | Retention | Export |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| Atlas | 120 USD | 40 projects | 7 days | CSV |\n| Birch | 180 USD | 75 projects | 14 days | JSON |\n| Cedar | 240 USD | 90 projects | 30 days | XML |\n\n## Recommendation\n\n**Best overall: Birch.** It offers a strong middle ground: materially higher project capacity and longer retention than Atlas, while costing less than Cedar. If you need the highest project limit and longest retention, Cedar is the premium option. If lowest price is the priority, Atlas is the budget option.\n\n## Citations\n\n- Atlas: Price 120 USD; limit 40 projects; retention 7 days; export CSV. Source: http://127.0.0.1:59302/atlas\n- Birch: Price 180 USD; limit 75 projects; retention 14 days; export JSON. Source: http://127.0.0.1:59302/birch\n- Cedar: Price 240 USD; limit 90 projects; retention 30 days; export XML. Source: http://127.0.0.1:59302/cedar",
